\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces The ULAL pipeline. UCF101 video is split by source group so no recording leaks across train/test (Stage\nobreakspace  {}1). A ResNet50+LSTM teacher is trained on the base classes (Stage\nobreakspace  {}2), extended to new classes by continual learning with a growing classifier head (Stage\nobreakspace  {}3), compressed into a small MobileNet student by knowledge distillation (Stage\nobreakspace  {}4), and finally adapted to brand-new classes from only a few clips with MAML (Stage\nobreakspace  {}5). Each caption shows that stage's headline result.}}{2}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:pipeline}{{1}{2}{The ULAL pipeline. UCF101 video is split by source group so no recording leaks across train/test (Stage~1). A ResNet50+LSTM teacher is trained on the base classes (Stage~2), extended to new classes by continual learning with a growing classifier head (Stage~3), compressed into a small MobileNet student by knowledge distillation (Stage~4), and finally adapted to brand-new classes from only a few clips with MAML (Stage~5). Each caption shows that stage's headline result}{figure.1}{}}
